  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Think rock paper scissors but overly complex.


    One fighter attacks
    first, the other defends.


    The attacker picks first.


    If its a player
    vs player fight, then the defender picks second.


    Fighters then swap (Attack<=>Defend)


    Each
    action has a type, which uses that specific type dice. Each dice has unique face
    values (see the bottom numbers)


    One type beats the other, in which an attack
    will deal more or less damage depending on the defend type.

    Ex.    <sprite=1>
    attack ->  <sprite=0> defend deals 2x DMG

    Ex.    <sprite=0> attack ->  <sprite=0>
    defend deals 1.5x DMG

    Ex.    <sprite=2> attack ->  <sprite=0> defend deals
    1x DMG



'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f14f4be18184b9d40943768620494e2d, type: 2}
